sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser UI
  participant E as Express API
  participant P as Prisma/PostgreSQL
  participant F as FastAPI service
  B->>E: Authenticated request + active organization
  E->>E: Verify session, membership, role/entitlement
  E->>P: Read organization-scoped inputs
  P-->>E: Readings/configuration
  E->>F: Analytical request (service configuration)
  F-->>E: Forecast, detection or optimization result
  E->>P: Persist validated output/evidence
  P-->>E: Persisted record
  E-->>B: Response for UI
